; Local server configuration. Copy to .user.ini and replace the example path.
; Do not commit .user.ini. Do not use "/" or disable open_basedir as a workaround.
; Source/master layout (the current server uses /www/wwwroot/finance/):
open_basedir=/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/finance/:/tmp/
; Customer packages use public/ as document root and the installer runtime policy.
